  "scope_precision": [
    "FlatUnionFindStable keeps found/output existential witnesses outside the forall extra, giving literal old endpoint stability.",
    "Primitive stable theorem conclusions expose ordered Results Related; they do not export a named old endpoint, although their proofs use the fixed stable witness.",
    "IsRoot includes absent/unallocated singleton roots and does not imply an allocated address.",
    "SupplyAligned means counter equals value-list length, without map-support bounds.",
    "Canonical means validity of stored suspended tries; it does not imply Safe or satisfiability.",
    "Full assignment equivalence uses the same supplied NodeLanguage and residual meaning on both related states.",
    "Native caches, Caller/memos, machine integers and full recursive worker correspondence remain outside this six-field state relation."
  ]
